WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.080
Black Flame Saber!

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.160
What?!

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.990
The Sacred Beasts are a symbol of strength!

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:04.980
Goodbye, Kai!

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:16.530
They look pretty shocked, don't they?

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:20.320
Understandably so.
They were crushed in battle.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:23.670
Not to mention losing their
Sacred Beasts. Of course they'd be down.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.870
But what about Kai's black Beyblade?

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.420
What <i>is</i> that thing?

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.650
I don't know. It's a completely mysterious Bey!

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.690
The way it devours other Sacred Beasts...

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:39.180
fills me with some sort of unease.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.580
Will the next battle go more smoothly?

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.600
Are you going to go up against Kai?

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:45.820
Rai...

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.620
Emily...

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:01.580
U-Um...

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:06.090
This isn't like you, Emily!

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.260
Cheer up!

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:14.050
Emily...

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:17.440
I won't forgive the Russian team.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.600
No, I won't ever forgive <i>you</i>, Kai!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.860
What are you going
to do about it?

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:25.320
Isn't it obvious? I'm taking
revenge in the next battle!

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:27.270
Revenge?

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.840
Do you plan on battling Kai?!

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.920
Duh! What, are you scared?

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.420
That's not it...

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:35.750
It's not, but...

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:36.990
What, then?

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:41.320
It's because we could
lose our Sacred Beasts.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.120
Right?

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:43.660
Yeah.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.240
Didn't you see it, Mao?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.850
The way Kai's Bey just sucks up Sacred Beasts.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.730
So what if it does?

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.600
Then all we have have do is win!

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:04.060
Do you think you'd beat an amazing Bey like that?

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.560
That thing's not normal.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.400
Whatever! I don't need you scaredy-cats!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.400
You can sit back and watch!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.610
What about you, Gaou?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:17.480
I will...

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.840
I will follow Lai.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.320
Lai-nii!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.480
What he's...

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.280
What Kai is doing is wrong.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.710
And what's wrong must be righted.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.660
I will take on Kai with my Galeon!

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:33.840
Lai-nii...

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.670
Fine! Do what you want!

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.390
You did well, all things considered.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:52.070
At the very least, you didn't soil Borg's reputation.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:52.600
Well done.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.860
Is something funny?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.820
Borg has nothing to do with this.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.630
I'm not fighting for your group's sake.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.160
What?!

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.980
In the end, this is for me.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.840
I'm only fighting so that
I can become my best self.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:16.420
Do what you will. You're
nothing but our backup, anyway.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.290
You really showed your true colors back there.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.650
Enough for today. Get some rest.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.180
What will you do about the Chinese Team?

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:29.980
You need not worry.
Yuri and the others will take care of them.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:34.980
Wait a moment, are you saying
we're only battling to let Kai sleep?

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:38.440
Don't overthink it.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:43.160
Kai has just become a part of Borg.
We shouldn't have him battle at all times.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.320
Even so...

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.280
Yuriy Ivanov!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.330
Yes.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:50.000
Do not be mistaken.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.420
This is an order.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:54.330
You three will stop the Chinese Team.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.340
What is it, Kai?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.290
I will fight.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.440
I'll defeat the Chinese team.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:06.840
Black Dranzer yearns for new Sacred Beasts.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:08.860
Very well.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:13.520
I don't care about my position in Borg.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.640
Quite the rash one...

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:25.860
I'll let him be.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:29.710
Now, the second match will begin
under the following special rules.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:34.590
The three Chinese Team members
are set to face Kai on his own!

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:37.820
He thinks he'll be okay on his own?

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:39.370
Way to underestimate us.

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:41.720
Gaou! You're up first!

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:42.060
Right.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.730
Three! Two! One!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.320
Go Shoot!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.620
That's Gaou's amazing power for ya!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.560
Look at that!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.080
Show me your strength!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.500
Death Rush!!

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:12.580
What?!

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.660
Finish him off!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.160
Kai is the winner!

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.840
My...

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.290
My Bey...

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.870
<i>No!</i> Galzzly got absorbed, too!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.050
What is that black-colored Dranzer?

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.390
I fear that by absorbing the PPB's Sacred Beasts,

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:09.690
it may be able to use their powers itself!

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.830
Is that even possible?!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.390
He's just destroying his opponents' Beys...

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.940
Is that how it is?

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:22.440
Mao of the Chinese Team is up next!

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.950
I misjudged you, Kai.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:28.240
You weren't like this back in the Chinese Tournament.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.160
Well, I guess you got the wrong idea, then.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:31.810
I will...

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:33.410
Three! Two! One!

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.170
never forgive you!

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:36.660
Go Shoot!

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.500
Catty Bites!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.580
There's no running away now!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:44.810
I'll rip you to shreds!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.350
He dodged it?!

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:51.850
You've got nice speed,
but is that the best you can do?

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.080
Now it's my turn.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.120
That's Trypio!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.360
Galux, run!

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:13.920
The scorpion's venom has begun to set in.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.200
There is no escape.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.320
No...

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.560
Even Galux...

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.650
He...

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:40.060
He destroyed his opponent's Bey again...

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.610
Mao..!

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:51.860
I won't let you get away

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.860
with destroying my friends' Beys.

00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:03.390
The match seems all but decided—
can the Chinese Team turn things around?

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:05.680
Three! Two! One!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:06.550
Here I go.

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:08.000
Go Shoot!

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:13.920
I will erase your Bey from my sight!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.620
Dark Lightning!

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:18.360
Show yourself, Trygator!

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.400
Not bad.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:32.370
I'll be happy to make a
Sacred Beast of such power my own.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.080
You talk big!

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:37.950
Go, Galeon!

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.160
Come forth, Trygle!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:46.920
It flew!

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.250
That's the match!

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:13.150
Kai scores a perfect victory!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.660
That makes seven.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:31.140
I can't believe he's destroying their
Beys and stealing their Sacred Beasts.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.670
What's happened to Kai?

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.310
This isn't the Kai we know!

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:38.760
It's like he reverted to his old Shell Killer self...

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:40.390
Jeez...

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:42.530
I've had enough!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.290
I'll go face-to-face with him and see for myself.

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:50.780
Kai..!

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:13.470
It's a bigger success than I'd imagined.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.650
They don't know when to quit.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.430
Kai! Come on out!

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:40.410
You're inside, right?

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.350
So say something!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.820
Are you happy now?

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.830
There's no one named Kai here.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.120
What do you want?

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.930
I believe your friends have arrived.

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:02.610
They must lack manners, thinking they
can barge in here at this time of night...

00:13:04.230 --> 00:13:06.060
What will you do?

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:11.020
This has nothing to do with me.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.760
Send them home.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:14.420
Oh, really?

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:22.480
Well, are you happy now?

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.000
If so, then please leave.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:25.680
No response.

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.330
What could this mean?

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.740
He should be here...

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.910
Let's search him out!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.790
Yeah!

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:33.320
- Kai!
- Kai!

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.550
Say something!

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:36.240
Kai!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:38.150
- Kai!
- Kai!

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.340
Kai!

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.600
The only place left is back here...

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.600
It won't open!

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:49.810
Stand back, Max!

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:51.440
Go!!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.710
Takao, that was too reckless!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.620
Like I care! Let's go!

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:01.110
Hold on!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.440
Got 'em!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.940
I found them! Over here!

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.880
Forget about me! Please, go on!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.280
You <i>must</i>—

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:13.830
- Over there!
- Get them!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.160
Leave this one to me. Hurry on!

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.800
Now! Quickly!

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:19.130
We're counting on ya, Max!

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.600
Over there!

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:33.950
End of the road?

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.980
Let's split up.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.370
I'll act as a decoy and distract them.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.490
Then you can go on ahead!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:40.980
Got it.

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:44.520
Found them!

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:48.630
Stop!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.630
Thank you, Rei.

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.590
- This way!
- Hurry!

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:23.840
A Bit?

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:34.910
T-This is a Sacred Beast!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.670
And stay out!

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:41.990
Rei! Are you okay?

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:43.210
What about Takao?

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:45.040
I don't know.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.220
All we can do is wait.

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:48.710
Takao...

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.920
What in the world..?

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.970
It is a miraculous device.

00:15:55.320 --> 00:16:02.160
A device that pushes the fighting
instincts of a Sacred Beast to their very limits.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:06.400
A miraculous device, fit to
create the ultimate Sacred Beasts.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.820
I'm sure you understand, Takao Kinomiya.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:12.370
That voice... is that you, Mr. Volkov?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:16.380
Well, this is the first time
you've seen me like this, isn't it?

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.830
W-Who the heck are you?!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:22.840
And where is this?

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:24.490
Borg!

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:29.890
An organization aiming to give birth to
the ultimate Sacred Beasts and Beybladers!

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:30.840
That is Borg.

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:33.860
Create the ultimate Beyblader?

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.510
Correct.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:39.730
By raising them to think of
nothing but battle from a young age,

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:41.980
we polish their offensive capabilities.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:46.190
At the same time, by developing unshakable spirits,

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:50.660
we can bring about Beybladers who have it in them to be the best.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:56.710
The Abbey is a facility made to
administrate raising said subjects.

00:16:57.900 --> 00:16:59.660
W-What?!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:04.380
Come to think of it, something
did seem off about the kids around here...

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.140
Even Kai Hiwatari

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:11.380
is a Beyblader that's come from Borg!

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.210
Lacking any shred of compassion,

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:18.690
he is a superb Beyblader that
never falters in pursuing the top.

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:22.340
He is the very definition of a warrior
created and perfected by Borg.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:26.620
I believe you'd best know that
after seeing today's matches.

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:32.320
The ultimate Sacred Beasts.
The ultimate Beybladers.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.130
Using them, Borg will rule the world!

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:37.950
I won't forgive you!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:39.920
Forgive me?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.170
So it may be.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:47.090
You won't be able to do anything to stop us, anyway.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.560
How can you be so sure?

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:53.020
It's impossible!

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:58.900
Sadly for you, your skills aren't
quite what you think they are.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.930
So what?

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.520
I might not be able to win by myself,

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.860
but I have friends by my side!

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:10.340
If one person isn't enough, then
we'll get two! If not two, then three!

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:12.450
Whatever it takes, we'll take you down!

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:17.130
And Kai's one of our allies, too!

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:18.040
A friend, even!

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:21.560
Kai's your ally?

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:22.720
No, a friend?

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:26.560
Can you still say that after seeing this?

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.420
What?!

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.330
Behold.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.540
Kai... and that's... me?

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.280
This is simulated footage.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.820
Here's what's really happening.

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.600
Start it.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:52.690
This simulation has perfectly
reproduced your movements.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.450
Dragoon's moves are
also faithful to the real one's.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.240
Black Flame Saber!

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:11.050
This is how Kai is training to fight you.

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:12.060
No way!

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:13.690
Good. Next.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:22.140
Our countermeasures should be
perfect come time for the finals.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:27.150
Please... Let me see Kai.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:28.900
Fine by me.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:33.640
Kai!

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:36.450
I don't know why you've come here,

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:37.900
but you're in luck.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.470
This is...

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:54.430
Something I no longer have use for.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:57.800
No way!

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:00.640
You've always—

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:03.020
You've always fought with Dranzer, haven't you?!

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.460
True, I did.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:10.750
But that is merely a relic of a time
where I was deceived by friendship,

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:14.540
rendered unable to become my strongest self.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:18.030
What happened to you, Kai?

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.890
You can go home.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:24.040
I'll settle the score with you later.

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:25.430
Kai...

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:44.640
Takao!

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:47.880
How did it go? Did you see Kai?

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:54.340
Takao, if it didn't work out,
we can always give it another <i>try</i>!

00:20:57.380 --> 00:20:58.780
No, it's fine.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:01.810
What are you saying, Takao?

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:03.630
Are you giving up?

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.030
I said it's fine.

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.300
Yes, it's fine...

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:23.830
Kai's not coming back.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.400
That Bey is...

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.520 --> 00:23:01.810
According to my analysis, Kai is being <i>Kai</i>nd of hostile!

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:05.380
Oh, how can I joke around at a time like this?!

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:07.370
Anyway, it's pretty serious!

00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:13.030
Kai calls us out to Lake Baikal and challenges us!

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:15.530
He intends on taking the BBA's Sacred Beasts!

00:23:15.530 --> 00:23:19.130
Fine... so let's take him
down with all we've got!

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:22.040
Next time: Showdown at Lake Baikal.

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:24.270
I'll be battling too, of course!
